WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Since I want to redeem my friend's life

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:06,120
Sir, does the young master know the name of this friend?

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:16,090
The little girl’s name is Liu Ping’er, so I feel relieved

4
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,450
I'm here

5
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:26,500
It's all a small problem. From now on Ping'er

6
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:29,520
You are free, sir

7
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:34,860
You can't redeem this girl Liu Ping'er. How can you say this?

8
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,100
If it were an ordinary girl

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,460
Naturally, the little ones don’t dare to come.

10
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:41,260
It's just that this Miss Liu is different, right

11
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,860
Miss Liu Ping'er's file

12
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,500
There is a decree from the late emperor

13
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:54,070
The Liu family has been slaves for generations and has done harm and cannot be redeemed, sir.

14
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:57,310
Can this matter be accommodated and let the young master go?

15
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,260
This is going to make you lose your head

16
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,860
What I dare not do

17
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,720
Sir, it’s hard work to help find the county clan.

18
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,680
Please treat me to tea with this little silver grain.

19
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,880
Just pretend I haven’t been here today

20
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:12,180
High officials always talk
